  "notes": "Released together with GPT-6 Luna; the GPT-6 Astra system card describes GPT-6 Sol as a highly capable, lower-cost alternative to Astra. In ChatGPT it is available in ChatGPT Work and Codex, not in Chat. One week later GPT-6.1 Sol followed (openai.gpt-6-1-sol). The launch page shows no publication date; Sep 22, 2026 comes from the API changelog and other OpenAI pages. The openai.com post was read through a Wayback Machine capture."
